    Xyz Materials on this card.) This card gains 1000 ATK for each Xyz Material attached
    to it. You can target 1 "Number" monster in your Graveyard; until your opponent''s
    next End Phase, this card''s name becomes that monster''s, and replace this effect
    with that monster''s original effects. You can only use this effect of "CXyz
    Barian Hope" once per turn.'
